# WP23-AUTHOR: makes the committed asset Content/Scenes/WP23_Regions.desce (+ __ExternalEntities__/WP23_Regions) that
# WP23.scn opens - a copy of WP_Protocol whose streaming follows the plane 9000002 (Scripts/World/WPFly.lua) with
# the Player's source 9000001 off, as WP-SRC-VELOCITY. Run once when WP_Protocol changes; commit the two paths it
# writes. HLODs are build output (Build HLODs in WP23.scn), not part of the asset.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
# A partitioned world saves as a copy only whole (594 of 601 entities live in unloaded cells otherwise).
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Когда save-as WP23_Regions
Когда set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Когда set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Когда set world WorldPartition.ChunkRegionSize 100000
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Тогда wp23_author окно редактора: открыт WP23_Regions (заголовок), мир разбит, все ячейки загружены
